{"id":"essai","lemma":"essai","pos":"noun","rank":1860,"glosses":["try, trial","assay","try"],"ipa":"/e.sɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/aa/Fr-essai.ogg/Fr-essai.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"essais"},"formAudio":{"essais":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-essais.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je ferai un essai.","en":"I'll give it a try.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"C'était un très bon essai.","en":"That was a very good try.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"good"},null]},{"text":"On va faire un essai.","en":"We'll give it a try.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tous les essais, sauf le vôtre, étaient bons.","en":"All the essays, other than yours, were good.","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"except, save"},null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"yours"]]},{"text":"J'en ferai l'essai.","en":"I'll give it a try.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}